three lines.

133
00:04:46,286 --> 00:04:48,604
Jar runs with: java dash jar.

134
00:04:48,604 --> 00:04:51,081
War needs: a servlet container.

135
00:04:51,081 --> 00:04:53,239
Manifest holds: main class.

136
